id: pm-px2raj
title: "Scorecard alert 29: patch newly disclosed follow-redirects credential-header vulnerabilities"
description: "The final live code-scanning inventory after PR1523 merge resurfaced Scorecard alert29 at main849dbf005. Two upstream high advisories published during the review, GHSA-8r9p-f939-6h3c at17:53Z and GHSA-q3jh-wrc6-jgq8 at17:58Z on2026-10-20, affect follow-redirects>=1.16.0<1.16.1. The current pnpm lock resolves1.16.0 under Axios1.20.0 in the CodSpeed development dependency graph. The registry audit still reports zero, so it is insufficient evidence against the fresh upstream advisories. No claim of a demonstrated exploit in pm-cli runtime is made."
