acceptance_criteria: "Use an explicit patched lower bound and an exact-version security age exception only where required; verify the resolved complete dependency graph, builds and maintained dependency/package gates; retain zero known security alerts on the final merged head; land tracked evidence and package-owned changelog through normal review."
parent: pm-qwoy
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: "Override follow-redirects to>=1.16.1<2 and resolve the CodSpeed/Axios graph to1.16.1. Preserve automatic cooldowns and audited CodSpeed bundles, source maps and native payload."
expected_result: Eliminate both newly published upstream advisories from the resolved graph while preserving dependency integrity and public SDK/package consumers.
actual_result: Installed graph and lock resolve1.16.1; OSV returns no advisories for it versus both GHSA IDs for1.16.0. Linked dependency/native-payload gate and hosted CI39479180880 pass;10852 tests pass with3 skips and exact100/100/100/100 coverage. Main Scorecard clearance remains a post-merge operational verification against the older alert instance.
